<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    @page {
      size: 8.5in 11in;
      margin: 0.5in;
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
      font-size: 12pt;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0;
      max-width: 7.5in;
    }
    
    .page {
      page-break-after: always;
      padding: 0.5in 0;
    }
    
    .page:last-child {
      page-break-after: auto;
    }
    
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    
    h2 {
      font-size: 14pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    
    h3 {
      font-size: 12pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 15px 0 8px 0;
    }
    
    p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      text-align: justify;
    }
    
    .info-box {
      border: 2px solid #000;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }
    
    .info-box h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .field {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 100px;
      padding: 0 5px;
    }
    
    .field-short {
      min-width: 80px;
    }
    
    .field-medium {
      min-width: 150px;
    }
    
    .field-long {
      min-width: 250px;
    }
    
    .field-full {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    
    .checkbox-group {
      margin: 10px 0 10px 20px;
    }
    
    .checkbox-item {
      margin: 5px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
    }
    
    .checkbox {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 15px;
      height: 15px;
      border: 1px solid #000;
      margin-right: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    
    .checkbox.checked::after {
      content: '✓';
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 15px;
    }
    
    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    
    .signature-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      width: 300px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }
    
    .date-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      width: 150px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }
    
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    
    table td {
      padding: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #000;
    }
    
    .indent {
      margin-left: 30px;
    }
    
    .bold {
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    ul {
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding-left: 40px;
    }
    
    li {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- PAGE 1 -->
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Pay and Stay Agreement</h1>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <h2>About This Agreement (Please Read)</h2>
      <p>
        This is a <strong>Pay and Stay Agreement</strong>. It is used when a landlord and tenant want to settle a rent or payment issue 
        without moving forward with an eviction.
      </p>
      <p>
        A Pay and Stay Agreement gives the tenant a <strong>chance to stay in their home</strong> by agreeing to pay the amount owed 
        through a payment plan. If the tenant makes the agreed payments on time, the landlord agrees <strong>not to file an eviction 
        case</strong>, or to dismiss an eviction case that has already started.
      </p>
      <p>
        This Agreement gives both sides clear expectations about:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>how much is owed,</li>
        <li>how and when payments will be made, and</li>
        <li>what happens if the tenant pays as agreed or does not pay as agreed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This document must be completed and signed by both the landlord and the tenant. Once signed, it becomes a binding 
        agreement that can be enforced.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Party Information</h2>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Landlord Name:</strong> 
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="landlord_name"><%= @landlord %></span>
    </p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Tenant Name(s):</strong> 
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="tenant_name"><%= @tenant %></span>
    </p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Property Address:</strong> 
      <span class="field field-full" data-agreement-field="address"><%= @address %></span>
    </p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Agreement Date:</strong> 
      <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="negotiation_date" data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= @date %></span>
    </p>

    <h2>Reason for Agreement</h2>
    
    <p>
      The parties are entering into this agreement for the following reason(s):
    </p>
    
    <p class="indent">
      <span data-agreement-field="reason"><%= @reason %></span>
    </p>

  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 2 -->
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Pay & Stay Negotiated Agreement</h1>
    
    <p>This Agreement is between:</p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Landlord:</strong> 
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="landlord_name"><%= @landlord %></span>
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Tenant(s):</strong> 
      <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="tenant_name"><%= @tenant %></span>
    </p>
    
    <p>
      The parties participated in a negotiation session on 
      <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="negotiation_date" data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= @date %></span>
      and reached the following agreement:
    </p>
    
    <h3>1. Reason for Agreement</h3>
    
    <p>The parties disagree about:</p>
    <p class="field field-full" data-agreement-field="reason"><%= @reason %></p>
    <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
    <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
    
    <p>
      This agreement is meant to help both sides resolve the issue, avoid eviction when possible, and create a clear plan 
      moving forward.
    </p>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>2. Amount Currently Owed</h3>
    
    <p>The tenant currently owes the landlord the following:</p>
    <p><strong>Total Amount Owed:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="money_owed"><%= @money_owed %></span></p>
    
    <p>This amount is for (check all that apply):</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @rent_owed.present? && @rent_owed.to_f > 0 ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Rent: $<span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="rent_owed"><%= @rent_owed.present? && @rent_owed.to_f > 0 ? @rent_owed : '___________' %></span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @late_fees.present? && @late_fees.to_f > 0 ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Late fees: $<span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="late_fees"><%= @late_fees.present? && @late_fees.to_f > 0 ? @late_fees : '___________' %></span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @utilities.present? && @utilities.to_f > 0 ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Utilities: $<span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="utilities"><%= @utilities.present? && @utilities.to_f > 0 ? @utilities : '___________' %></span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @other_charges.present? && @other_charges.to_f > 0 ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Other charges (list): $<span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="other_charges_description"><%= @other_charges_description.present? ? @other_charges_description : '___________' %></span> = $<span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="other_charges"><%= @other_charges.present? && @other_charges.to_f > 0 ? @other_charges : '___________' %></span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>3. Payment Plan (Pay & Stay Terms)</h3>
    
    <p>To resolve this balance, the tenant agrees to make the following payments:</p>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Regular Rent:</strong> Tenant will continue to pay regular monthly rent of $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="monthly_rent"><%= @monthly_rent %></span>.
    </p>
    
    <p><strong>Additional Payments Toward Balance (Check all that apply):</strong></p>
    
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_lump_sum" data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_lump_sum ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          <strong>Lump Sum Payment:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="lump_sum_amount"><%= @lump_sum_amount.present? ? @lump_sum_amount : '___________' %></span>
          due on or before <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="lump_sum_date"><%= @lump_sum_date.present? ? @lump_sum_date : '___________' %></span> at 5:00 PM
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_monthly" data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_monthly ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          <strong>Monthly Payments:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_amount"><%= @monthly_payment_amount.present? ? @monthly_payment_amount : '___________' %></span>
          per month for <span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_months"><%= @monthly_payment_months.present? ? @monthly_payment_months : '___________' %></span> months, due on or before the
          <span class="field field-short" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_day"><%= @monthly_payment_day.present? ? @monthly_payment_day : '___________' %></span> day of each month, starting
          <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="monthly_payment_start"><%= @monthly_payment_start.present? ? @monthly_payment_start : '___________' %></span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_final" data-agreement-value="1">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_final ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>
          <strong>Final Payment:</strong> $<span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="final_payment_amount"><%= @final_payment_amount.present? ? @final_payment_amount : '___________' %></span>
          due on or before <span class="field field-medium" data-agreement-field="final_payment_date"><%= @final_payment_date.present? ? @final_payment_date : '___________' %></span> at 5:00 PM
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <p><strong>Payment Method (Select one):</strong></p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="online_portal">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method == 'online_portal' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Online portal (Note: Some portals do <strong>not</strong> accept partial payments. Tenant and Landlord must confirm in advance 
        that this payment plan can be processed through the portal.)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="money_order">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method == 'money_order' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Money order</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="cashiers_check">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method == 'cashiers_check' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Cashier's check</span>
      </div>
      <div class="checkbox-item" data-agreement-choice="payment_method" data-agreement-value="other">
        <div class="checkbox<%= @payment_method == 'other' ? ' checked' : '' %>"></div>
        <span>Other (describe): <span class="field field-long" data-agreement-field="payment_method_other_description"><%= @payment_method == 'other' && @payment_method_other_description.present? ? @payment_method_other_description : '___________' %></span></span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 3 -->
  <div class="page">
    <p>
      Payments must be made using a method accepted by both parties unless they agree otherwise in writing.
    </p>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>4. Rental Assistance</h3>
    
    <p>
      The landlord agrees to accept third-party rental assistance payments, and both parties will take timely steps to 
      submit and process the rental assistance application. The landlord is not required to follow any requirements beyond 
      what federal law requires to accept those payments.
    </p>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>5. Mediation and Communication</h3>
    
    <p>
      A mediator may review and support communication between the parties. Mediators do not give legal advice and 
      cannot make decisions for the parties.
    </p>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>6. If the Tenant Pays as Agreed</h3>
    
    <p>If the tenant makes <strong>all payments</strong> listed in Sections 3 and 4:</p>
    
    <ul>
      <li>The landlord will <strong>not</strong> file an eviction case based on the balance covered by this agreement.</li>
      <li>The tenant may <strong>remain in the property</strong>.</li>
      <li>Any pending eviction case will be dismissed by the next court date.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>7. If the Tenant Does Not Pay as Agreed</h3>
    
    <p>
      If the Tenant(s) fail to make any payment as agreed, the landlord may proceed with an eviction action under <strong>ORC 
      Chapter 1923</strong>.
    </p>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>8. Additional Terms</h3>
    
    <p>Any additional terms agreed to by both parties are listed here:</p>
    
    <% if @additional_terms.present? %>
      <p data-agreement-field="additional_terms"><%= @additional_terms %></p>
    <% else %>
      <p class="field field-full" data-agreement-field="additional_terms">___________</p>
      <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
      <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
      <p class="field field-full">___________</p>
    <% end %>
    
    <hr style="border: 1px solid #000; margin: 15px 0;">
    
    <h3>9. Signatures and Final Agreement</h3>
    
    <p>
      Both parties agree that this Agreement may be executed in one or more counterparts, each of which may be signed 
      by a party individually. Upon execution by all parties, their respective signed copies of this Agreement shall be 
      combined into a single, integrated document. The integrated agreement shall be deemed the final, complete, and 
      enforceable version of this Agreement.
    </p>
    
    <div class="signature-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>
        <strong>Landlord:</strong> 
        <span class="signature-line">___________</span>
        <span style="margin-left: 50px;"><strong>Date:</strong> <span class="date-line">___________</span></span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Tenant:</strong> 
        <span class="signature-line">___________</span>
        <span style="margin-left: 50px;"><strong>Date:</strong> <span class="date-line">___________</span></span>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
